rooms_desc ({"You are in the local village church. The church has the service of revivingghosts. Dead people come to church and pray. There is a huge pit in thecenter. Back on the north wall is an entrance to the new Holy Mission WeddingChapel. In the east wall you notice the entrance to a small side room, thechurch portal opens to the south. You feel the peace and holiness of thisplace and you are sure the gods would punish the sacrilage of shedding bloodhere. There is a sideroom to the west.Please note: We don't like serial killers.             Offenders will be punished.WE ARE NOT OFFICIALLY OPEN - YOU PLAY AT YOUR OWN RISK. SO BE WARNED AND DONTCOME CRYING IF YOU DIE! ALSO TAKE NOT THAT THE MUD IS OPEN TEMPORARILY. ITCOULD CLOSE OR CRASH AT ANY TIME. BE WARNED!!!!!!","This is the temple of Silas. In front of you a a VERY large idol of a goldensheep. You feel the urge to get on your knees and start worshipping it. Theroom is simply decorated in gold silk curtains and drapery. There are a fewwindows that allow the sun to magnificantly shine on the sheep before you.There are a few pews towards the back of the room. Take notice that nooneis in here. The room is very silent.","You have entered a long dark hallway. You can see a tiny light at the endof the hallway. You feel stirs of cold air coming from that directionalso. As you move closer the east, you feel wierd sensations of raw energyand power flowing freely through you. You wonder what it could be.","This is Gehenna's storage room. She keeps all her things she gathersthat she doesnt need here and then takes them to the shop at the endof the day to sell them. Funny tho, thieves come every time there isa reboot and steal all her stuff away. Maybe someday she will be able to stop that. ","You are deeper into the hallway. You start to shiver from the chill rushingthrough the air. You notice the light from the east is a glowing black. Yousee streams of colored mana flowing past you to the west. Transleuscent beamsof energy tingle your skin as you move nearer to the east door. A sudden fearcomes accross you as you feel the power inflicted upon you from that room.You see an inscription on the door to the east.","Everything is dead silent in here. Four large columns stand erect in fourpoints of a large elaborate pentagram carved into the floor. Candles arearranged in a way not understood to your inferiority. There is an alter atthe top point of the pentagram. Upon the alter you see the tools in whichGehenna uses for her spell castings and rituals. There is a cauldron of bloodbeside the alter. The smell hints that a recent event occured. The room isquite warm considering the chill in the hallway. Yet you still are overwhelmedby the enormous amount of power you feel in this room. There is a shelf madeof wood that supports Gehenna's books. You might recognize some of the books.Hanging from the ceiling is a chandalier which holds 70 candles. The eleganceof the room is surprising for a room which holds unsightly festivals of eviland summons ungodly horrible creations. You feel like you are not wanted here.","A cozy little room where Gehenna like's to sit and talk with people. Youdefinately feel welcome here. There is a couch on the wall, two loveseatsnear the fireplace and a table with chairs around it, in the center of theroom. On top of the fireplace you see pictures of Gehenna's family andfriends. There are a few posters and wall hangings on the walls around youthat seem to draw your attention. Take a look at them. You hear the faintnoice of people partying in the room to the west.","        GGGG  AAAA  N    N  JJJJJ  AAAA        G     A  A  NN   N    J    A  A        G     AAAA  N N  N    J    AAAA        G GG  A  A  N   NN    J    A  A        G  G  A  A  N    N  J J    A  A        GGGG  A  A  N    N  JJJ    A  A           TTTTTT  II  M   M  EEEE  !!             T     II  MM MM  E     !!             T     II  M M M  EEE   !!             T     II  M   M  E     !!             T     II  M   M  EEEE  **This is the room that Gehenna likes to throw her parties.","This is Gehenna's bedroom. The room is half empty except for a large bedthat is completely dressed in leather. Leather sheets, leather blankets,leather pillows, the works. Also there is a footdresser on the bed. You seethat one of the drawers is open. There are rings, buckles, ropes, and cords attached to the bed and dresser, in which you suddenly start tofeel kinky. You also see a sign on the wall with a small inscription onit. The room has a few pictures, but the wallpapering is that of manyskeletons in various sexual positions. You start to wonder what Gehenna islike in bed.",0,})
